    {
      "blocked_by": "OP-SWR-001",
      "checklist_item": "IQ-02",
      "description": "SYS-SUP-022 requires the outputs and status signal to reach their specified levels within 50 ms of the detectable instant. OP-SWR-001 states that the software budget consumes the full 50 ms up to the output write while assuming negligible output-drive delay; the inputs do not establish that delay. The allocation therefore does not establish that the system deadline can be met.",
